{"id":"e6cfefe696c9c5cc","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-proper-lown.md","title":"任意 oracle 上的真 Lowₙ 层","display":"df-proper-lown — 任意 oracle 上的真 Lowₙ 层","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-proper-lown","aliases":["20-df-proper-lown"],"display":"df-proper-lown — 任意 oracle 上的真 Lowₙ 层","chapter":"9","section":"9.5；9.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Theorem 9.5.1 后的注；§9.7","source_printed_pages":[179,181],"source_pdf_pages":[211,213],"depends_on":["[[20-df-low-high]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-proper-lown"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-proper-lown</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proper-lown — 任意 oracle 上的真 Lowₙ 层"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.5；9.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.5.1 后的注；§9.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>179</span><span>181</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper-lown}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProperLow}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_n(A)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Low}_{n-1}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper-lown}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProperLow}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_n(A)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Low}_{n-1}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是全体 oracle 上的谓词；若同时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T0\\prime\\)</span>，才对应第 4 章 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_n\\setminus L_{n-1}\">\\(L_n\\setminus L_{n-1}\\)</span> 的度层。特别是特殊有效闭类中的 HIF–low₂ 见证通常位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> 的不可比锥，不能说它属于该图中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 9.5.1 后的注；§9.7；印刷页 179, 181；PDF 第 211, 213 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-low-high]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proper-lown}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProperLow}_n(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_n(A)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Low}_{n-1}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\le_T0\\prime","display":false},{"tex":"L_n\\setminus L_{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"0\\prime","display":false},{"tex":"L_2","display":false}],"bytes":1184,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c68778d3c902ef0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-proper-lown]]；see [[20-thm-hif-low2-basis]]；see [[20-cor-nonzero-hif-incomparable]]。"}],"outgoing":["91065cedbdf2fc27"]}